{"id":"xQ4vtGKEaro","title":"[Time] What time is it? - Easy Dialogue - Role Play","speaker":"English Singsing","channel":"Kids","level":"A1","duration":"04:22","views":"455K","emoji":"👶","color":"linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a, #fee140)","zh":"【English Singsing】[時間] 現在幾點了？ - 輕鬆對話 - 角色扮演（精選雙語跟讀教材）","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xQ4vtGKEaro","cues":[{"start":1.65,"duration":1.6,"text":"English singsing.","en":"English singsing.","zh":"英文歌聲。"},{"start":3.25,"duration":4.17,"text":"What time is it?","en":"What time is it?","zh":"現在是幾奌？"},{"start":7.42,"duration":9.81,"text":"What time is it, Dad?","en":"What time is it, Dad?","zh":"現在幾點了，爸爸？"},{"start":17.23,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's seven o'clock.","en":"It's seven o'clock.","zh":"已經七點了。"},{"start":19.23,"duration":2.0,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":21.23,"duration":4.18,"text":"What time is it?","en":"What time is it?","zh":"現在是幾奌？"},{"start":25.41,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's eight.","en":"It's eight.","zh":"八點了。"},{"start":27.41,"duration":2.64,"text":"Time for breakfast.","en":"Time for breakfast.","zh":"吃早餐的時間到了。"},{"start":30.05,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay, coming.","en":"Okay, coming.","zh":"好的，來了。"},{"start":32.05,"duration":4.27,"text":"Are you ready?","en":"Are you ready?","zh":"你準備好了嗎？"},{"start":36.32,"duration":3.0,"text":"Yes, we're ready.","en":"Yes, we're ready.","zh":"是的，我們準備好了。"},{"start":39.32,"duration":2.6,"text":"Good, let's go to school.","en":"Good, let's go to school.","zh":"好，我們去學校吧。"},{"start":41.92,"duration":4.53,"text":"Let's go home.","en":"Let's go home.","zh":"我們回家吧。"},{"start":46.77,"duration":2.0,"text":"Please, wait for me.","en":"Please, wait for me.","zh":"請等我。"},{"start":48.77,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay.","en":"Okay.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":50.77,"duration":6.58,"text":"It's late. Time for bed.","en":"It's late. Time for bed.","zh":"現在已經太晚了。睡覺時間到了。"},{"start":57.35,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay, good night, Mom.","en":"Okay, good night, Mom.","zh":"好的，晚安，媽媽。"},{"start":59.35,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night, Dad.","en":"Good night, Dad.","zh":"晚安，爸爸。"},{"start":61.35,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night.","en":"Good night.","zh":"晚安。"},{"start":63.35,"duration":16.69,"text":"What time is it, Dad?","en":"What time is it, Dad?","zh":"現在幾點了，爸爸？"},{"start":80.04,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's seven o'clock.","en":"It's seven o'clock.","zh":"已經七點了。"},{"start":82.04,"duration":2.0,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":84.04,"duration":4.24,"text":"What time is it?","en":"What time is it?","zh":"現在是幾奌？"},{"start":88.28,"duration":3.25,"text":"It's eight.","en":"It's eight.","zh":"八點了。"},{"start":91.53,"duration":2.0,"text":"Time for breakfast.","en":"Time for breakfast.","zh":"吃早餐的時間到了。"},{"start":93.53,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay, coming.","en":"Okay, coming.","zh":"好的，來了。"},{"start":95.53,"duration":4.27,"text":"Are you ready?","en":"Are you ready?","zh":"你準備好了嗎？"},{"start":100.12,"duration":2.0,"text":"Yes, we're ready.","en":"Yes, we're ready.","zh":"是的，我們準備好了。"},{"start":102.12,"duration":3.0,"text":"Good, let's go to school.","en":"Good, let's go to school.","zh":"好，我們去學校吧。"},{"start":108.12,"duration":2.0,"text":"Let's go home.","en":"Let's go home.","zh":"我們回家吧。"},{"start":110.12,"duration":2.0,"text":"Please, wait for me.","en":"Please, wait for me.","zh":"請等我。"},{"start":112.12,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay.","en":"Okay.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":114.12,"duration":6.55,"text":"It's late. Time for bed.","en":"It's late. Time for bed.","zh":"現在已經太晚了。睡覺時間到了。"},{"start":120.67,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay, good night, Mom.","en":"Okay, good night, Mom.","zh":"好的，晚安，媽媽。"},{"start":122.67,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night, Dad.","en":"Good night, Dad.","zh":"晚安，爸爸。"},{"start":124.67,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night.","en":"Good night.","zh":"晚安。"}],"words":[]}